OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with heavy rain soon
OL,6,Fclearing eastwards in the morning.
OL,7,FThis leaves a largely dry afternoon
OL,8,Fwith sunny spells developing, but also
OL,9,Fsome showers. Breezy with strong winds
OL,10,Fover Argyll.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers this evening will
OL,13,Flargely clear, with a dry night
OL,14,Ffollowing and long clear periods.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FMostly dry throughout the
OL,17,Fdaytime with some good sunny spells
OL,18,Fbetween patchy amounts of cloud.
OL,19,FModerate winds, but occasionally fresh
OL,20,Faround Argyll.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
